<title>CHINA: TRADING IN SHK HONG KONG IND SUSPENDED.</title>
<headline>TRADING IN SHK HONG KONG IND SUSPENDED.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of SHK Hong Kong Industries Ltd was suspended at the direction of the Hong Kong Stock Exchange, the bourse said on Friday.</p>
<p>The company's shares ended the morning at HK$0.72 each.</p>
<p>SHK Hong Kong Industries is an investor in Hong Kong or Macau industrial companies.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong News Room (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
